<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Die For You"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="VALORANT"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Grabbitz"/><amll:meta key="album" value="VALORANT Sounds, Vol. 1"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QZH6S1900411"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="0EIiEUREYnDRHbWKP55o4F"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="125193605"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="st-6"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:31.567"><div begin="6.952" end="3:31.567"><p begin="6.952" end="11.396" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.952" end="7.264">Time</span> <span begin="7.264" end="7.927">slows</span> <span begin="7.927" end="8.493">down</span> <span begin="8.493" end="8.831">when</span> <span begin="8.831" end="9.156">it</span> <span begin="9.156" end="9.487">can</span> <span begin="9.487" end="9.819">get</span> <span begin="9.819" end="10.447">no</span> <span begin="10.447" end="11.396">worse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在无可挽回之时 时间也会慢下脚步</span></p><p begin="12.009" end="16.436" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.009" end="12.302">I</span> <span begin="12.302" end="12.867">can</span> <span begin="12.867" end="13.556">feel</span> <span begin="13.556" end="13.894">it</span> <span begin="13.894" end="14.531">running</span> <span begin="14.531" end="15.155">out</span> <span begin="15.155" end="15.786">on</span> <span begin="15.786" end="16.436">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我能感到它正从我身边流逝</span></p><p begin="16.761" end="21.460" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.761" end="17.053">I</span> <span begin="17.053" end="17.391">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="17.391" end="17.996">want</span> <span begin="17.996" end="18.977">these</span> <span begin="18.977" end="19.250">to</span> <span begin="19.250" end="19.556">be</span> <span begin="19.556" end="19.848">my</span> <span begin="19.848" end="20.524">last</span> <span begin="20.524" end="21.460">words</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不希望这会是我最后的遗言</span></p><p begin="22.104" end="26.563" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.104" end="22.403">All</span> <span begin="22.403" end="23.020">for</span><span begin="23.020" end="23.690">got</span><span begin="23.690" end="23.995">ten</span> <span begin="23.995" end="24.307">&apos;cause</span> <span begin="24.307" end="24.671">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="24.671" end="25.250">all</span> <span begin="25.250" end="25.893">they&apos;ll</span> <span begin="25.893" end="26.563">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所有的遗忘皆是命中注定</span></p><p begin="27.154" end="31.600" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.154" end="27.447">Now</span> <span begin="27.447" end="27.759">there&apos;s</span> <span begin="27.759" end="28.428">only</span> <span begin="28.428" end="29.059">one</span> <span begin="29.059" end="29.702">thing</span> <span begin="29.702" end="30.307">I</span> <span begin="30.307" end="30.944">can</span> <span begin="30.944" end="31.600">do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如今我能做的只是</span></p><p begin="32.204" end="36.571" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.204" end="32.481">Fight</span> <span begin="32.481" end="33.127">until</span> <span begin="33.127" end="33.491">the</span> <span begin="33.491" end="34.089">end</span> <span begin="34.089" end="34.397">like</span> <span begin="34.397" end="34.746">I</span> <span begin="34.746" end="35.363">pro</span><span begin="35.363" end="35.649">mised</span> <span begin="35.649" end="36.571">to</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">践行诺言 战至终章</span></p><p begin="37.229" end="42.080" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.229" end="37.846">Wishing</span> <span begin="37.846" end="38.189">there</span> <span begin="38.189" end="38.483">was</span> <span begin="38.483" end="39.147">some</span><span begin="39.147" end="39.783">thing</span> <span begin="39.783" end="40.440">left</span> <span begin="40.440" end="41.025">to</span> <span begin="41.025" end="42.080">lose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">愿身边仍有可弃之物</span></p><p begin="42.318" end="46.575" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.318" end="42.604">This</span> <span begin="42.604" end="42.916">could</span> <span begin="42.916" end="43.234">be</span> <span begin="43.234" end="43.566">the</span> <span begin="43.566" end="44.194">day</span> <span begin="44.194" end="44.840">I</span> <span begin="44.840" end="45.464">die</span> <span begin="45.464" end="45.802">for</span> <span begin="45.802" end="46.575">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">今天或是我为你赴死之日</span></p><p begin="47.352" end="51.793" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.352" end="47.671">What</span> <span begin="47.671" end="47.970">do</span> <span begin="47.970" end="48.282">you</span> <span begin="48.282" end="48.906">see</span> <span begin="48.906" end="49.523">before</span> <span begin="49.523" end="49.887">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="49.887" end="50.483">o</span><span begin="50.483" end="51.793">ver?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在一切落下帷幕前 你看到了什么</span></p><p begin="52.368" end="56.840" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.368" end="53.018">Blind</span><span begin="53.018" end="53.324">ing</span> <span begin="53.324" end="54.221">flashes</span> <span begin="54.221" end="54.565">get</span><span begin="54.565" end="54.936">ting</span> <span begin="54.936" end="55.527">clo</span><span begin="55.527" end="56.840">ser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">炫目的闪光步步逼近</span></p><p begin="57.500" end="1:02.094" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begi